<ArticleLayout
  title="Weekend Recap — May 18, 2026"
  date="May 18, 2026"
  author="Konstantinos Chaldoupis"
  tags={[
    "weekend-recap",
    "premier-league",
    "laliga",
    "serie-a",
    "bundesliga",
    "ligue-1",
  ]}
>
  <!-- Simple Navigation -->
  <div
    style="background: #1e293b; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 2rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center;"
  >
    <a href="#premier-league" style="color: #93c5fd; text-decoration: none;"
      >Premier League</a
    >
    <span style="color: #475569;">|</span>
    <a href="#laliga" style="color: #93c5fd; text-decoration: none;">La Liga</a>
    <span style="color: #475569;">|</span>
    <a href="#serie-a" style="color: #93c5fd; text-decoration: none;">Serie A</a
    >
    <span style="color: #475569;">|</span>
    <a href="#bundesliga" style="color: #93c5fd; text-decoration: none;"
      >Bundesliga</a
    >
    <span style="color: #475569;">|</span>
    <a href="#ligue-1" style="color: #93c5fd; text-decoration: none;">Ligue 1</a
    >
  </div>

  <!-- Premier League -->
  <h2 id="premier-league">🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿 Premier League: Matchday 37</h2>

  <p>
    Manchester United secured a commanding victory over Nottingham Forest,
    taking an early lead through <strong>Luke Shaw</strong> and maintaining their
    advantage until halftime. Forest briefly threatened after the break when Morato
    pulled one back in the 53rd minute, but United responded emphatically. <strong
      >Matheus Cunha</strong
    > swiftly restored the lead for the Red Devils before <strong
      >Bryan Mbeumo</strong
    > added a third in the 76th minute to seal the win. Adding to the celebration,
    <strong>Bruno Fernandes</strong> equalled the all-time Premier League assist record
    for a single season during the match.
  </p>

  <MatchCard
    client:load
    homeTeam="Manchester United"
    awayTeam="Nottingham Forest"
    homeScore={3}
    awayScore={1}
    competition="Premier League — Matchday 37"
    competitionLogo={PremierLeague?.src || ""}
    status="FT"
    homeLogo={ManUTDLogo?.src || ""}
    awayLogo={NottmForestLogo?.src || ""}
  />

  <hr />

  <!-- La Liga -->
  <h2 id="laliga">La Liga: Matchday 38</h2>

  <p>
    <strong>Atletico Madrid 1-0 Girona:</strong> A tight contest decided by a late
    winner as Atletico secured all three points at home.
  </p>

